                  "name": "The orb is always there. Lis",
                  "fill": "#3A3F4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The orb is always there. Listening adds rings that breathe with your voice. Not listening puts the orb to sleep, grey with a mic-off mark and the words beside it, for as long as the mic is off.",
