                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Cards grow out of the orb along the tail (280 ms, standard curve, no overshoot), and the tail settles last. The rings follow the mic level at 30 fps. A new edge rises out of the orb. Reduced motion: a 120 ms fade, with static rings.",
