                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Three edges (102 px) plus the confirm in its halo (412 px) need 514 px, and the window leaves 466 above the orb, so Send would be cut off. Proposal: with edges behind, the confirm compacts (a shorter band, tighter spacing, the email preview clamped to two lines) to 341 px, so the deck takes 443 of 466.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "VS4Ki",
                  "name": "Presence exceptions (10, 11)",
                  "width": "fill_container",
