                  "name": "Swift as a native Windows 11",
                  "fill": "#2B2B2B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Swift as a native Windows 11 surface. Every card names its state in its first line, and a coloured spine down its left edge says the same in colour, so what's in front is obvious at a glance.",
