                  "name": "Listening turns the dock int",
                  "fill": "#3A3A3A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Listening turns the dock into a wide live waveform of your voice. Not listening shows a striped spine, a mic-off mark and the words, for as long as the mic is off. Stripes appear nowhere else.",
