                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The spine leads: it appears first and the card unrolls from it (280 ms, standard curve, no overshoot). An answer's reading time drains down its spine. A new edge slides out of the rail into its slot. Reduced motion: a 120 ms fade.",
