                  "fill": "#2B2B2B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "What the system needs beyond the eight brief states: the Deck's landing, and its fold with an OK waiting, the presence exceptions while a card is open, the tightest fit, the top anchor, the two separate windows and a busy wallpaper.",
