                  "name": "A confirm card with three ed",
                  "fill": "#3A3A3A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A confirm card with three edges behind uses 455 of the 493 px the window leaves above the rail, with 38 px to spare. Rail is the only direction with room for a longer email preview.",
