          "fill": "#3A3F4D",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1400,
          "content": "Four rungs instead of one card per tool call. The product rules are floors no rung lowers: recipients only from contacts, a bare “yes” never approves, typing never approves, deleting a file always asks. Learning never climbs the ladder. Amber still means one thing: an OK is waiting now.",
