          "name": "The overlay can sit at six p",
          "fill": "#3A3F4D",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1400,
          "content": "The overlay can sit at six places. The card grows away from the orb, the edges sit on the far side of the card, and the tail always points at the orb. At the side positions the orb sits 44 px in from the card's edge, so the tail clears the corner radius. Gutter: 16 px.",
