                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Tail x = orb centre − card left − 12, clamped to 28 … card width − 52 so it never meets the 22 px corner. Bottom anchors: tail on the card's bottom edge, pointing down. Top anchors: on the top edge, pointing up, and the card's square corners swap to the edge side.",
