                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "C9hsIp",
                  "name": "Applies only when edges are ",
                  "fill": "#3A3F4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Applies only when edges are behind a Needs your OK card and card + deck would exceed the window's free height. Then: band 42 → 36 px, body gap 14 → 10, facts padding 12 → 10, email preview clamped to two lines, footer padding 14 → 10. Never removed: any fact, the voice rule, any button, the countdown. Measured: 412 → 341 px, so three edges fit in 443 of 466 px.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
